_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104461","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104461","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104461.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104461.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-22T15:46:12Z"},"body":"In the editor UI for Action Sets, the priority of an Action Set is currently changed with a TextEdit node, this commit changes it to an EditorSpinSlider. This clarifies the internal structure of the Action Set by making it clear inside the editor that the priority is an integer.\r\n\r\nIn order to test this change, create a new project and go to Project Settings -> XR -> OpenXR -> Enabled, and enable XR. This should create a tab on the bottom bar labeled \"OpenXR Action Map.\" This tab is where the change is visible, directly to the left of the `plus` button in the Godot action set.\r\n\r\nBefore the change:\r\n<img width=\"1073\" alt=\"Image of the TextEdit with the rest of the UI\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/140e8dc6-822f-4c05-ae34-cc9295a56d63\" />\r\n\r\nAfter the change:\r\n<img width=\"980\" alt=\"Image of the EditorSpinSlider with the rest of the UI\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/72154e84-ace6-4f50-a81e-ec951e0c4297\" />\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/